-> t_final: final physical time
-> eq: 20(euler), 21(euler + viscous terms)
-> diffusion: 0(BR1), 1(BR2)
-> viscosity: constant dynamic viscosity used by the 1D Navier-Stokes viscous flux
-> Pr: Prandtl number
